i la prochaine fois ? C'est tr\u00e8s bon pour la sant\u00e9.", "id": 5, "time": "30500"}]}}], "_data": [{"content": [], "type": "tips"}]}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "picture", "value": {"audiosrc": "frn1le04ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "frn1le04ob06re2img01.jpg", "images": []}}], "_data": []}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Quelles activit\u00e9s vos parents font-ils le week-end&nbsp;?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Quelles activit\u00e9s faites-vous le week-end&nbsp;?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Je peux d\u00e9crire la fr\u00e9quence des activit\u00e9s.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux parler des activit\u00e9s quotidiennes.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Demandez \u00e0 votre coll\u00e8gue : ", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Vous allez souvent faire du yoga&nbsp;? Parlons des activit\u00e9s quotidiennes&nbsp;!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Pierre et Nadine, vont-ils souvent \u00e0 <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_2\">la salle de sport</span> ? D\u00e9couvrons-le !", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Essayez encore une fois !", "type": "text"}, {"content": "La 